{
"name": "valve_eli_work_spots_repairs",
"note": "Black Mesa East's repair floor, the third the lift passes (d1_eli_01, 880 under the top landing): the first 816 of a corridor 192 wide, ceiling 128, five substation transformers along its walls, deck and cage lights. In 'wiring': two vortigaunts and a citizen standing at the machines, a hidden npc_bullseye (no damage, not solid) in front of a transformer, and the ai_relationships that make the vortigaunts hate it for about 5 s so their beams zap the machine, then the relay that removes them. Faces -y (the lift's gate at y 0; the corridor runs to +y); anchor on the floor at the middle of the gate. docs/dev/prefabs.md, 'Pieces with their wiring'.",
